</style></head><body><h1>IRC channel logs</h1><h2>2025-01-11.log</h2><p><a href="/bootstrappable">back to list of logs</a></p><div id="logs"><div class="line" id="010812"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#010812" label="[01:08:12]">&lt;rkeene&gt;</a></span><span class="message">Yeah</span></div><div class="line" id="010951"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#010951" label="[01:09:51]">&lt;rkeene&gt;</a></span><span class="message">stikonas, Added to <a rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/oriansj/M2libc/pull/64">https://github.com/oriansj/M2libc/pull/64</a> </span></div><div class="line" id="011101"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#011101" label="[01:11:01]">&lt;rkeene&gt;</a></span><span class="message">I'm going to ressurect <a rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/oriansj/M2libc/pull/17">https://github.com/oriansj/M2libc/pull/17</a>  as well, since it seems useful to have it</span></div><div class="line" id="011440"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#011440" label="[01:14:40]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">ok, I'll update stage0-posix once M2libc is merged</span></div><div class="line" id="011458"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#011458" label="[01:14:58]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">(well, I also need to go over submodule changes and update changelog...)</span></div><div class="line" id="011547"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#011547" label="[01:15:47]">&lt;rkeene&gt;</a></span><span class="message">I'll be back from dinner in a few hours with a new <a rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/oriansj/M2libc/pull/17;">https://github.com/oriansj/M2libc/pull/17;</a>  it didn't apply cleanly to main (maybe some parts were already applied?)</span></div><div class="line" id="011601"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#011601" label="[01:16:01]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">yeah, some parts were applied</span></div><div class="line" id="011619"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#011619" label="[01:16:19]">&lt;stikonas&gt;</a></span><span class="message">and I think you already cherry-picked some other parts</span></div><div class="line" id="044417"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#044417" label="[04:44:17]">&lt;rkeene&gt;</a></span><span class="message">I think all of M2libc#17 still needs to be applied, it just doesn't apply cleanly because of some changes I made</span></div><div class="line" id="044521"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#044521" label="[04:45:21]">&lt;rkeene&gt;</a></span><span class="message">Actually, the mkdirat commit seems to have been done</span></div><div class="line" id="044755"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#044755" label="[04:47:55]">&lt;rkeene&gt;</a></span><span class="message"> <a rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/oriansj/M2libc/pull/65">https://github.com/oriansj/M2libc/pull/65</a> </span></div><br /></div></body></html>